          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakati wakuoneapo ubatili, wakati wakufanyiao uganga wa uongo, ili kukuweka juu ya shingo zao waliotiwa jeraha kiasi cha kuwaua, ambao siku yao imekuja, katika wakati wa uovu wa mwisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uurudishe alani mwake. Mahali pale ulipoumbwa, katika nchi uliyozaliwa; nitakuhukumu wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nitamwaga ghadhabu yangu juu yako; nitakupulizia moto wa hasira yangu; nami nitakutia katika mikono ya watu walio kama hayawani, wajuao sana kuangamiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utakuwa kuni za kutiwa motoni; damu yako itakuwa katikati ya nchi; hutakumbukwa tena; maana mimi, BWANA, nimenena neno hili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.32"
            ]
